  displayName: Golem
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57e55f59eb6e9604285c224893a5dba5, type: 3}
  description: A golem is a large construct, a towering mass of stone, clay, or metal
    shaped into a humanoid form. It moves with a heavy, slow march that shakes the
    ground with each step. It is completely silent - no breath, no voice, no growl
    - only the grinding of material and the dull impact of its feet.
